{
  "name": "ReviewPilot - GitHub MCP Diagnostic (Phase 6)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ReviewPilot - GitHub MCP Diagnostic (Fase 6)\n- **Objetivo:** validar a conexão `HTTP Streamable` (`httpStreamable`) com o servidor oficial remoto `https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/` em modo somente leitura.\n- **Credencial exigida:** `ReviewPilot GitHub MCP Read-Only` (`Multiple Headers Auth` com `Authorization: Bearer <PAT>`, `X-MCP-Readonly: true` e `X-MCP-Toolsets: repos,pull_requests`).\n- **Como testar:** no nó `Configure Sandbox Repository Target`, substitua `YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME` pelo seu usuário do GitHub (dono do repositório `auto-elite`) e clique em **Test workflow**.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 680
      },
      "id": "e6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "GitHub MCP Diagnostic Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "e6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "When clicking 'Test workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-owner",
              "name": "owner",
              "value": "YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-repo",
              "name": "repo",
              "value": "auto-elite",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-sha",
              "name": "sha",
              "value": "main",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-per-page",
              "name": "perPage",
              "value": 5,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Configure Sandbox Repository Target",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        340
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Set owner to your GitHub username and repo to auto-elite."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/",
        "authentication": "multipleHeadersAuth",
        "tool": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "list_commits"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={\n  \"owner\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.owner) }},\n  \"repo\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.repo) }},\n  \"sha\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.sha) }},\n  \"perPage\": {{ Number($json.perPage) }}\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "e6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Query Sandbox Commits via GitHub MCP",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        760,
        340
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "httpMultipleHeadersAuth": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID_GITHUB_MCP_HEADERS",
          "name": "ReviewPilot GitHub MCP Read-Only"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Executes read-only list_commits on remote GitHub MCP Server via Streamable HTTP."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "ok-status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "GITHUB_MCP_READONLY_SUCCEEDED",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ok-transport",
              "name": "transport",
              "value": "httpStreamable",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ok-tool",
              "name": "toolExecuted",
              "value": "list_commits",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ok-result",
              "name": "mcpResult",
              "value": "={{ $json }}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Format GitHub MCP Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1080,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "err-status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "GITHUB_MCP_CALL_FAILED",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "err-stage",
              "name": "stage",
              "value": "GITHUB_MCP_INVOCATION",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "err-category",
              "name": "failureCategory",
              "value": "={{ String($json.error?.message ?? $json.error ?? '').match(/401|403|unauthorized|forbidden|token/i) ? 'AUTHENTICATION_OR_PERMISSION' : (String($json.error?.message ?? $json.error ?? '').match(/404|not found/i) ? 'REPOSITORY_OR_RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND' : (String($json.error?.message ?? $json.error ?? '').match(/timeout|timed out|502|503|504/i) ? 'TIMEOUT_OR_TRANSIENT' : 'MCP_PROTOCOL_OR_INPUT_ERROR')) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "err-msg",
              "name": "sanitizedMessage",
              "value": "Falha ao consultar GitHub MCP Server. Confirme a credencial ReviewPilot GitHub MCP Read-Only, o valor de owner no nó Configure Sandbox Repository Target e as permissões de leitura do token no repositório auto-elite.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Classify GitHub MCP Failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1080,
        460
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
